# Local notes (personal, not shared)

Copy this file to `CLAUDE.local.md` (gitignored) and fill in your own values.
Claude Code loads `CLAUDE.local.md` alongside the shared `CLAUDE.md` automatically.

Local checkout path: C:\Users\<you>\...\RTPMgoogle

Add anything else here that's true for you specifically but would be noise or
wrong for a teammate — e.g. a personal dev-server port override, local-only
debug accounts, or notes-to-self mid-task.
